    "license": "Apache-2.0 模型生成"
  },
  {
    "text": "呢首音樂好好聽，聽完之後，我覺得好快樂。",
    "jyutping": "ni1 sau2 jam1 ngok6 hou2 hou2 teng1 teng1 jyun4 zi1 hau6 ngo5 gok3 dak1 hou2 faai3 lok6",
    "file": "audio/sentences/canto-09.wav",
    "kind": "Canto 整句",
    "source": "https://huggingface.co/typangaa/canto-tts-nano",
    "license": "Apache-2.0 模型生成"
  },
  {
    "text": "聽日如果落雨，我哋就改搭地鐵去中環；如果天氣好，就先去海邊行下，再搵間餐廳食飯。",
    "jyutping": "ting1 jat6 jyu4 gwo2 lok6 jyu5 ngo5 dei6 zau6 goi2 daap3 dei6 tit3 heoi3 zung1 waan4 jyu4 gwo2 tin1 hei3 hou2 zau6 sin1 heoi3 hoi2 bin1 haang4 haa6 zoi3 wan2 gaan1 caan1 teng1 sik6 faan6",
    "file": "audio/sentences/canto-10.wav",
